# Loxodon Surveyor, {2}{G} 3/3 Elephant Scout: "Start your engines!" and "Max speed — {3}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Draw a card."
# The static ability functions in the graveyard (CR 113.6b, 702.178b) and grants the ability only while its owner's speed is 4 (702.178a).
